<title>USA: TABLE-Hibernia Corp Q2 shr $0.25 vs $0.22.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hibernia Corp Q2 shr $0.25 vs $0.22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>2Q						    1997     1996  Chg</p>
<p>  Net income				     $32,935  $28,143  17%</p>
<p>  Net income per common share		    .25	.22  14%</p>
<p>  Avg common shares			    127,209  126,620   -%</p>
<p>  6 MOS.						  97	 96  Chg</p>
<p>  Net income					63,549   54,445  17%</p>
<p>  Net income per common share		    .47	.43   9%</p>
<p>  Avg common shares			    127,241  126,572   1%</p>
<p>(All figures in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>NOTES: Returns on assets and common equity were 1.40 percent and 14.63 percent, respectively, for the second quarter of 1997, compared to 1.43 percent and 14.55 percent in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The net interest margin in Q2 1997 was 4.87 percent, compared to 4.94 percent for the second quarter last year.</p>
